---Time spent in various aspects from order to the delivery of the product.
---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.DeliveryTime
---@field minTransitDays? number Minimum number of business days that is spent in transit. 0 means same day delivery, 1 means next day delivery. Either `min_transit_days`, `max_transit_days` or `transit_time_table` must be set, but not both.
