---Shipping rate group definitions. Only the last one is allowed to have an empty `applicable_shipping_labels`, which means "everything else". The other `applicable_shipping_labels` must not overlap.
---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.RateGroup
---@field carrierRates? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CarrierRateList Optional. A list of carrier rates that can be referred to by `main_table` or `single_value`.
---@field singleValue? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.Value The value of the rate group (For example flat rate $10). Can only be set if `main_table` and `subtables` are not set.
