---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateAutofeedSettingsAccountsAutofeedSettingsRequest
---@field enableProducts? boolean Required. Enables or disables product crawling through the autofeed for the given account. Autofeed accounts must meet [certain conditions](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7538732#Configure_automated_feeds_Standard_Experience), which can be checked through the `eligible` field. The account must **not** be a marketplace. When the autofeed is enabled for the first time, the products usually appear instantly. When re-enabling, it might take up to 24 hours for products to appear.
---@field eligible? boolean Output only. Determines whether the business is eligible for being enrolled into an autofeed.
---@field name string Identifier. The resource name of the autofeed settings. Format: `accounts/{account}/autofeedSettings`.
---@field updateMask? string Required. List of fields being updated.

---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateAutomaticImprovementsAccountsAutomaticImprovementsRequest
---@field itemUpdates? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.AutomaticItemUpdates Turning on [item updates](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/3246284) allows Google to automatically update items for you. When item updates are on, Google uses the structured data markup on the website and advanced data extractors to update the price and availability of the items. When the item updates are off, items with mismatched data aren't shown. This field is only updated (cleared) if provided in the update mask.
---@field shippingImprovements? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.AutomaticShippingImprovements Not available for [advanced accounts](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/188487). By turning on [automatic shipping improvements](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/10027038), you are allowing Google to improve the accuracy of your delivery times shown to shoppers using Google. More accurate delivery times, especially when faster, typically lead to better conversion rates. Google will improve your estimated delivery times based on various factors: * Delivery address of an order * Current handling time and shipping time settings * Estimated weekdays or business days * Parcel tracking data This field is only updated (cleared) if provided in the update mask.
---@field imageImprovements? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.AutomaticImageImprovements This improvement will attempt to automatically correct submitted images if they don't meet the [image requirements](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324350), for example, removing overlays. If successful, the image will be replaced and approved. This improvement is only applied to images of disapproved offers. For more information see: [Automatic image improvements](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/9242973) This field is only updated (cleared) if provided in the update mask.
---@field name string Identifier. The resource name of the automatic improvements. Format: `accounts/{account}/automaticImprovements`.
---@field updateMask? string Required. List of fields being updated. The following fields are supported (in both `snake_case` and `lowerCamelCase`): - `item_updates` - `item_updates.account_level_settings` - `image_improvements` - `image_improvements.account_level_settings` - `shipping_improvements` - `shipping_improvements.allow_shipping_improvements`

---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateBusinessIdentityAccountsBusinessIdentityRequest
---@field smallBusiness? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.IdentityAttribute Optional. Specifies whether the business identifies itself as a small business. This optional field will only be available for businesses with a business country set to `US`. It is also not applicable for marketplaces.
---@field womenOwned? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.IdentityAttribute Optional. Specifies whether the business identifies itself as being women-owned. This optional field will only be available for businesses with a business country set to `US`. It is also not applicable for marketplaces or marketplace sellers.
---@field latinoOwned? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.IdentityAttribute Optional. Specifies whether the business identifies itself as being latino-owned. This optional field will only be available for businesses with the business country set to `US`. It is also not applicable for marketplaces or marketplace sellers.
---@field veteranOwned? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.IdentityAttribute Optional. Specifies whether the business identifies itself as being veteran-owned. This optional field will only be available for businesses with a business country set to `US`. It is also not applicable for marketplaces or marketplace sellers.
---@field blackOwned? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.IdentityAttribute Optional. Specifies whether the business identifies itself as being black-owned. This optional field will only be available for businesses with the business country set to `US`. It is also not applicable for marketplaces or marketplace sellers.
---@field promotionsConsent? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.BusinessIdentityPromotionsConsentEnum|string Required. Whether the identity attributes may be used for promotions.
---@field updateMask? string Optional. List of fields being updated. The following fields are supported (in both `snake_case` and `lowerCamelCase`): - `black_owned` - `latino_owned` - `promotions_consent` - `small_business` - `veteran_owned` - `women_owned`
---@field name string Identifier. The resource name of the business identity. Format: `accounts/{account}/businessIdentity`

---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateBusinessInfoAccountsBusinessInfoRequest
---@field customerService? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CustomerService Optional. The customer service of the business.
---@field address? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.PostalAddress Optional. The address of the business. Only `region_code`, `address_lines`, `postal_code`, `administrative_area` and `locality` fields are supported. All other fields are ignored.
---@field koreanBusinessRegistrationNumber? string Optional. The 10-digit [Korean business registration number](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/9037766) separated with dashes in the format: XXX-XX-XXXXX.
---@field phone? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.PhoneNumber Output only. The phone number of the business.
---@field phoneVerificationState? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.BusinessInfoPhoneVerificationStateEnum|string Output only. The phone verification state of the business.
---@field name string Identifier. The resource name of the business info. Format: `accounts/{account}/businessInfo`
---@field updateMask? string Optional. List of fields being updated. The following fields are supported (in both `snake_case` and `lowerCamelCase`): - `address` - `customer_service` - `korean_business_registration_number`

---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateCheckoutSettingsAccountsProgramsCheckoutSettingsRequest
---@field effectiveReviewState? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CheckoutSettingsEffectiveReviewStateEnum|string Output only. The effective value of `review_state` for a given merchant ID. If account level settings are present then this value will be a copy of the account level settings. Otherwise, it will have the value of the parent account (for only marketplace sellers).
---@field effectiveEnrollmentState? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CheckoutSettingsEffectiveEnrollmentStateEnum|string Output only. The effective value of enrollment_state for a given merchant ID. If account level settings are present then this value will be a copy of the account level settings. Otherwise, it will have the value of the parent account (for only marketplace sellers).
---@field uriSettings? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UriSettings URI settings for cart or checkout URL.
---@field enrollmentState? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CheckoutSettingsEnrollmentStateEnum|string Output only. Reflects the merchant enrollment state in `Checkout` program.
---@field effectiveUriSettings? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UriSettings Output only. The effective value of `uri_settings` for a given merchant. If account level settings are present then this value will be a copy of url settings. Otherwise, it will have the value of the parent account (for only marketplace sellers).
---@field reviewState? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CheckoutSettingsReviewStateEnum|string Output only. Reflects the merchant review state in `Checkout` program. This is set based on the data quality reviews of the URL provided by the merchant. A merchant with enrollment state as `ENROLLED` can be in the following review states: `IN_REVIEW`, `APPROVED` or `DISAPPROVED`. A merchant must be in an `enrollment_state` of `ENROLLED` before a review can begin for the merchant.For more details, check the help center doc.
---@field eligibleDestinations? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.CheckoutSettingsEligibleDestinationsItemEnumList Optional. Required for the create operation. The destinations (also known as [Marketing methods](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/15130232)) to which the checkout program applies. Valid destination values are `SHOPPING_ADS` and `FREE_LISTINGS`.
---@field updateMask? string Required. List of fields being updated. The following fields are supported (in both `snake_case` and `lowerCamelCase`): - `eligible_destinations` - `uri_settings`
---@field name string Identifier. The resource name of the program configuration settings. Format: `accounts/{account}/programs/{program}/checkoutSettings`

---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateEmailPreferencesAccountsEmailPreferencesRequest
---@field newsAndTips? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.EmailPreferencesNewsAndTipsEnum|string Optional. Updates on new features, tips and best practices.
---@field updateMask? string Required. List of fields being updated. The following fields are supported (in both `snake_case` and `lowerCamelCase`): - `news_and_tips`
---@field name string Identifier. The name of the EmailPreferences. The endpoint is only supported for the authenticated user.

---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_accounts_v1.UpdateHomepageAccountsHomepageRequest
---@field claimed? boolean Output only. Whether the homepage is claimed. See [About online store URL verification](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/176793). This field is also `true` if the account inherits the claim from its advanced account, or if the account is exempted from claiming, even when the homepage isn't claimed directly on the account.
